OL,3,GNEWSARural lives cannot be an
OL,4,A'afterthought', healthcare campaigners
OL,5,Asay
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn 2024, former Health Minister Mike
OL,8,FNesbitt proposed a new hospital network
OL,9,Fwhich would see healthcare services
OL,10,Fspread and shared across counties, with
OL,11,Fpatients expected to travel further for
OL,12,Fspecialist treatment.
